 "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tEnglish–Tashlhit Dictionary\n\t\n\nAn English → Tashlhit (Tachelhit, Shilha; ISO 639-3 shi) dictionary. It has 8,629 English\nheadwords and 50,204 Tashlhit translations, and 45,943 of those translations come with a\nTashlhit example sentence. Every translation and example is given in Latin script and in\nTifinagh.\n\nAuthor: Lahcen Oulhaj. All rights to the dictionary content belong to the author.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tConfigurations\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\ttranslations (default): one row per translation… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Tamazight-NLP/English-Tashlhit-Dictionary.",
